How many microservices were in your production environment?
 
1. In my previous role  the entire ecosystem consisted of about 40 microservices

2.my specific team was directly responsible for 5 core services related to the user domain. 

3.To manage these services, we used centralized logging (ELK Stack)  

4. We used an API Gateway to handle cross-cutting concerns like authentication. 

5.To handle data consistency we used the Event-Driven Architecture. 

6. To monitor many services we used Prometheus/Grafana for metrics 
